Concerned that the methylation_extraction operation may have been the cause of the implausible results obtained, I imported the bam files from Bismark directly into methylkit and then counted the CpGs. Please see my codes below:

#Sort the files
bam_4 <- BamFile("S4_pe.bam")
reads <- readGAlignments(bam_4)

# Define input and output file paths
input_bam_4 <- "S4_pe.bam"
output_bam_4 <- “S4_sorted.bam"

# Sort the BAM files
sortBam(input_bam_4, destination=output_bam_4)

#Read the sorted files at 1X coverage.
S4_1 <- processBismarkAln("S4_sorted.bam.bam",
                          sample.id <http://sample.id>="S1_1",
                          assembly = "hg18",
                          save.folder = NULL,
                          save.context = c("CpG"),
                          read.context="CpG",
                          nolap = FALSE,
                          mincov = 1,
                          minqual = 20,
                          phred64 = FALSE,
                          treatment = NULL,
                          save.db = FALSE,
                          verbose = 1)

I repeated this for all the samples at  3X, 5X, and 10X coverage (codes not shown)

Result:

